# Netlify SPA fallback.
#
# Flutter web is a single-page app: every route is resolved client-side by the
# router inside index.html. Without this, any URL other than "/" — or any
# refresh on a deep link — 404s.
#
# Real files always win over this rule, so assets under /assets/, /canvaskit/
# and the icons still load normally.
#
# One rule per line, and the rule must not be wrapped: this file is not
# whitespace-insensitive the way netlify.toml is. Splitting `/*` and its
# destination across two lines parses as a rule with no destination, which the
# CLI reports as a syntax error and Netlify then ignores — silently, leaving
# every deep link 404ing. deploy_netlify.sh checks the shape for this reason.
/*    /index.html   200
